  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "小谷不是骆琳  (Xiaogu Is Not Luo Lin)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Pressing his point, Kaiwen urges Chun Yuqiao not to step back from romance—inadvertently touching on Chun Yuqiao's painful past with Luo Lin. Listen to their Mandarin exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你到底要说什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我跟你说句真心话吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "如果换作是我，但凡有一丝优势能让杏子来到我身边，我想都不想就去追。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "感情这种事，根本用不着让着谁啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "可是杏子现在是单身。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "单身不单身有什么关系，谁能争得过你淳于乔啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这样的事，你以前见到过，是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我就是随口一说，你千万别生气了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我知道骆琳的事，你是不想再经历一次了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "但是现在的状况不一样，小谷她不是骆琳！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我要是你，我早就主动出击了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你到底要说什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What exactly are you trying to say?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我跟你说句真心话吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me tell you the honest truth.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "如果换作是我，但凡有一丝优势能让杏子来到我身边，我想都不想就去追。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If I were in your shoes with even the slightest edge to win Xingzi over, I would go for it without a second thought.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "感情这种事，根本用不着让着谁啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In matters of the heart, there is zero need to step aside for anyone!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "可是杏子现在是单身。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Except Xingzi happens to be single.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "单身不单身有什么关系，谁能争得过你淳于乔啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Single or not, what does it matter—who could possibly compete with Chun Yuqiao?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这样的事，你以前见到过，是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You witnessed something just like that once before, did you not?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我就是随口一说，你千万别生气了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was just talking off the cuff—please do not get upset.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我知道骆琳的事，你是不想再经历一次了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know you never want to go through what happened with Luo Lin ever again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "但是现在的状况不一样，小谷她不是骆琳！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet things are different now—Xiaogu is not Luo Lin!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我要是你，我早就主动出击了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If I were you, I would have made my move long ago.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
